        "Coherent breathing is the pace used in HRV biofeedback, which is where most of the interest in it comes from. So the obvious question is whether the app shows your HRV going up. It shows heart rate before and after a session, measured on Apple Watch. For HRV it shows a 30-day trend read from Apple Health, alongside the days you practised, and nothing per session.",
